{"3738830": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "FIRE STATE", "steam_appid": 3738830, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>New realistic gunshot sounds are now live, and they feel amazing! Go check them out! New animations and a new control system are coming very soon too!!!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overview:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FIRE STATE is a tactical shooter played from a realistic bodycam-style perspective. We aim to strike a careful balance between intense realism and fluid playability, delivering an adrenaline-charged battlefield experience while ensuring that every action feels precise and responsive. Prepare to enter dangerous operational zones, where your body camera will capture every critical moment.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>In-Depth Overview:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience tense, high-intensity confrontations through a deeply immersive first-person body camera perspective. We know that pure realism can sometimes come at the cost of accessible controls. That is why, alongside carefully crafting visual fidelity, physical feedback, and environmental audio, our development team has devoted substantial effort to optimizing the controls and player interface. The result delivers the impact of a realistic battlefield while letting you carry out every tactical intention smoothly and confidently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738830/extras/a70062b359c8dc5ac265318dac341ac0.poster.avif?t=1787716037\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738830/extras/a70062b359c8dc5ac265318dac341ac0.webm?t=1787716037\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738830/extras/a70062b359c8dc5ac265318dac341ac0.mp4?t=1787716037\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FIRE STATE does more than recreate and refine the traditional shooter experience. Its competitive modes are built for players who value marksmanship, tactical judgment, and intense head-to-head action.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world's first FPS game rendered with 3DGS: Through our efforts, 3DGS is no longer just a technical demo video on the internet—it has truly made its way into a game. In our game, you will experience world-leading real-time 3DGS rendering technology. If you want to experience this technology, your search ends here.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738830/extras/4555f475075fbbf14724e43b38e4c8ac.poster.avif?t=1787716037\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738830/extras/4555f475075fbbf14724e43b38e4c8ac.webm?t=1787716037\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738830/extras/4555f475075fbbf14724e43b38e4c8ac.mp4?t=1787716037\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Highly immersive </strong>realistic bodycam-style perspective<strong>:</strong> Presented through distinctive recorder footage, camera movement and a restricted field of view create authentic pressure and unprecedented tactical depth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Top-tier visuals:</strong> Drawing on extensive technical experience and deep optimization for Unreal Engine 5, we deliver industry-leading visual quality. An RTX 3060-class graphics card can maintain smooth performance at <u><strong>maximum graphics settings</strong></u>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738830/extras/dc446bfba3c2dd0db34bb1dd2b95064f.poster.avif?t=1787716037\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738830/extras/dc446bfba3c2dd0db34bb1dd2b95064f.webm?t=1787716037\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738830/extras/dc446bfba3c2dd0db34bb1dd2b95064f.mp4?t=1787716037\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A refined balance of realism and playability:</strong> Realistic elements such as environmental interaction, ballistic trajectories, and powerful audio are paired with carefully tuned controls, creating a smooth and intuitive experience where hardcore simulation and satisfying gunplay are no longer mutually exclusive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738830/extras/b5359488ff2dda01093b5bd071d7dc5c.poster.avif?t=1787716037\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738830/extras/b5359488ff2dda01093b5bd071d7dc5c.webm?t=1787716037\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738830/extras/b5359488ff2dda01093b5bd071d7dc5c.mp4?t=1787716037\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic competitive modes:</strong> Take on time-tested traditional PVP modes, including Team Deathmatch, Zone Control, and Demolition, and use your marksmanship and tactical judgment to outplay your opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738830/extras/0acc39546281edc6cac9068bf175565a.poster.avif?t=1787716037\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738830/extras/0acc39546281edc6cac9068bf175565a.webm?t=1787716037\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738830/extras/0acc39546281edc6cac9068bf175565a.mp4?t=1787716037\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you are a tactical expert seeking an authentic battlefield or a competitive player ready to test your skills against other players, <strong>FIRE STATE</strong> delivers a one-of-a-kind experience worth recording. Are you ready to switch on your camera and define your own battlefield legend?<br><br><i>“</i><strong>FIRE STATE</strong><i>” is independently developed and published by UNDER FIRE. This game is not affiliated with, authorized by, sponsored by, endorsed by, or associated with any third-party game studio, publisher, or trademark owner.</i><br><br><br></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>New realistic gunshot sounds are now live, and they feel amazing! Go check them out! New animations and a new control system are coming very soon too!!!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overview:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FIRE STATE is a tactical shooter played from a realistic bodycam-style perspective. We aim to strike a careful balance between intense realism and fluid playability, delivering an adrenaline-charged battlefield experience while ensuring that every action feels precise and responsive. Prepare to enter dangerous operational zones, where your body camera will capture every critical moment.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>In-Depth Overview:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience tense, high-intensity confrontations through a deeply immersive first-person body camera perspective. We know that pure realism can sometimes come at the cost of accessible controls. That is why, alongside carefully crafting visual fidelity, physical feedback, and environmental audio, our development team has devoted substantial effort to optimizing the controls and player interface. The result delivers the impact of a realistic battlefield while letting you carry out every tactical intention smoothly and confidently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738830/extras/a70062b359c8dc5ac265318dac341ac0.poster.avif?t=1787716037\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738830/extras/a70062b359c8dc5ac265318dac341ac0.webm?t=1787716037\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738830/extras/a70062b359c8dc5ac265318dac341ac0.mp4?t=1787716037\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FIRE STATE does more than recreate and refine the traditional shooter experience. Its competitive modes are built for players who value marksmanship, tactical judgment, and intense head-to-head action.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world's first FPS game rendered with 3DGS: Through our efforts, 3DGS is no longer just a technical demo video on the internet—it has truly made its way into a game. In our game, you will experience world-leading real-time 3DGS rendering technology. If you want to experience this technology, your search ends here.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738830/extras/4555f475075fbbf14724e43b38e4c8ac.poster.avif?t=1787716037\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738830/extras/4555f475075fbbf14724e43b38e4c8ac.webm?t=1787716037\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738830/extras/4555f475075fbbf14724e43b38e4c8ac.mp4?t=1787716037\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Highly immersive </strong>realistic bodycam-style perspective<strong>:</strong> Presented through distinctive recorder footage, camera movement and a restricted field of view create authentic pressure and unprecedented tactical depth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Top-tier visuals:</strong> Drawing on extensive technical experience and deep optimization for Unreal Engine 5, we deliver industry-leading visual quality. An RTX 3060-class graphics card can maintain smooth performance at <u><strong>maximum graphics settings</strong></u>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738830/extras/dc446bfba3c2dd0db34bb1dd2b95064f.poster.avif?t=1787716037\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738830/extras/dc446bfba3c2dd0db34bb1dd2b95064f.webm?t=1787716037\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738830/extras/dc446bfba3c2dd0db34bb1dd2b95064f.mp4?t=1787716037\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A refined balance of realism and playability:</strong> Realistic elements such as environmental interaction, ballistic trajectories, and powerful audio are paired with carefully tuned controls, creating a smooth and intuitive experience where hardcore simulation and satisfying gunplay are no longer mutually exclusive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738830/extras/b5359488ff2dda01093b5bd071d7dc5c.poster.avif?t=1787716037\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738830/extras/b5359488ff2dda01093b5bd071d7dc5c.webm?t=1787716037\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738830/extras/b5359488ff2dda01093b5bd071d7dc5c.mp4?t=1787716037\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic competitive modes:</strong> Take on time-tested traditional PVP modes, including Team Deathmatch, Zone Control, and Demolition, and use your marksmanship and tactical judgment to outplay your opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738830/extras/0acc39546281edc6cac9068bf175565a.poster.avif?t=1787716037\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738830/extras/0acc39546281edc6cac9068bf175565a.webm?t=1787716037\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738830/extras/0acc39546281edc6cac9068bf175565a.mp4?t=1787716037\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you are a tactical expert seeking an authentic battlefield or a competitive player ready to test your skills against other players, <strong>FIRE STATE</strong> delivers a one-of-a-kind experience worth recording. Are you ready to switch on your camera and define your own battlefield legend?<br><br><i>“</i><strong>FIRE STATE</strong><i>”